  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aqua for All - Making Water Count</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aqua for All focuses on development and scaling of sustainable drinking water and sanitation concepts in developing countries. Aqua for All contributes to bridging the finance and service gap by unlocking private capital in favor of structural access to clean water and safe sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
